BT /F2 20 Tf 54 760 Td (Zerve ODSC Datathon: Dataset Progress Report) Tj ET
0.15 w 54 739 m 558 739 l S
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 721 Td (This report summarizes the data understanding work completed so far on the Zerve events dataset.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 706 Td (It focuses on schema discovery, missing-value structure, grouped-null interpretation, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 691 Td (implications for leakage-safe funnel and modeling work.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 665 Td (Dataset Snapshot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 647 Td (- Original shape observed: 3,509,628 rows x 83 columns.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 630 Td (- Each row appears to represent one product analytics event tied to a person, timestamp, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 615 Td (  event name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 598 Td (- The schema includes person properties, browser/device metadata, geolocation fields, AI usage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 583 Td (  metadata, product activity fields, billing/credit fields, marketing attribution, page) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 568 Td (  engagement fields, and web-vitals metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 551 Td (- A dtype warning appeared during CSV load because several property columns contain mixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 536 Td (  types. This is expected in event exports, where sparse properties can vary by event type.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 509 Td (Current Interpretation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 491 Td (The dataset should be treated as an event log, not as a flat user table. Many null values are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 476 Td (likely structural: a property is missing because it does not apply to that event. Missingness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (itself can become a useful signal, especially after aggregating events to the person or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (workspace level.) Tj ET
endstream
