BT /F2 20 Tf 54 760 Td (Schema Understanding) Tj ET
0.15 w 54 739 m 558 739 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 715 Td (Major Column Families Found) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 697 Td (- Core identifiers: person_id, timestamp, event. These have no missing values and define the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 682 Td (  event grain.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 665 Td (- Person properties: cloud provider, purpose, role, source, and work type. These describe user) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 650 Td (  profile or onboarding context.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 633 Td (- Browser/device/geography: browser, language, OS, device type, screen size, country,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 618 Td (  continent, and time zone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 601 Td (- AI interaction properties: input tokens, output tokens, latency, model, provider, tool call) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 586 Td (  count, and tools called.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 569 Td (- Product activity properties: canvas_id, workspace_id, block types, file type/extension,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 554 Td (  requirements status, tool name, button/link names, and object counts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 537 Td (- Credit/subscription properties: credits used/received/remaining, total credits, add-on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 522 Td (  credits, amount, subscription type, and seats.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 505 Td (- Marketing attribution: UTM source, medium, campaign, content, and term.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 488 Td (- Page engagement/performance: previous pageview scroll/content metrics and web-vitals values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 473 Td (  such as CLS, FCP, INP, and LCP.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 446 Td (Important Data Understanding Point) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (The same event row will not contain every property. For example, an AI event may contain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 413 Td (model/token/latency fields, while a pageview may contain scroll fields, and a billing event may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398 Td (contain credit fields. This makes grouped missingness a useful way to infer subsystems and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 383 Td (event-specific feature families.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
