BT /F2 20 Tf 54 760 Td (Implications for Feature Engineering) Tj ET
0.15 w 54 739 m 558 739 l S
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 715 Td (What This Means) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 697 Td (- Do not blindly drop high-null columns. In an event log, sparse fields often identify) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 682 Td (  meaningful event types.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 665 Td (- Create presence flags for important sparse groups, such as has_ai_usage, has_ai_tool_call,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 650 Td (  has_credit_snapshot, has_pageview_engagement, and has_subscription_signal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 633 Td (- Aggregate row-level events to person_id or workspace_id before modeling. Useful features) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 618 Td (  include total events, unique event count, active days, first event, last event, AI event) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 603 Td (  count, total tokens, average latency, canvas/file/block activity, and credit-related) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 588 Td (  activity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 571 Td (- Use grouped missingness to build feature families. Columns with identical null counts likely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 556 Td (  originate from the same product subsystem or event instrumentation path.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 539 Td (- Handle categorical missing values as Unknown or Not Applicable, depending on whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 524 Td (  missingness means unavailable user metadata or not relevant for the event.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 497 Td (Useful Presence-Flag Examples) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 479 Td (- has_ai_usage = properties.$ai_model is not null) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 462 Td (- has_ai_tool_usage = properties.$ai_tool_call_count is not null) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 445 Td (- has_credit_snapshot = properties.credits_remaining is not null) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 428 Td (- has_pageview_scroll_data = properties.$prev_pageview_max_scroll is not null) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 411 Td (- has_subscription_signal = properties.subscription_type is not null) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
